WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.968 --> 00:00:01.968
-I'm in the giving spirit.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.367
I'm in the giving spirit
tonight.

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:06.167
I mean, why does just one person
get a gift? Why --

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:08.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:11.367
Why can't everyone
in the audience get a gift?!

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.367
That's right! It's time for

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.200
"Tonight Show"
Stocking Stuffers!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.400
-♪ Hey, girl ♪

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.801
♪ I wanna be your midnight
stocking stuffer ♪

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:28.767
♪ H-e-e-e-ey ♪

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:31.100
-Every night
until Christmas break,

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.300
we're giving away
an awesome gift

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.534
to every single person
in our studio audience.

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:38.634
You guys want to see
what you're taking home tonight?

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:43.400
Questlove, drum roll, please!

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.734
[ Drum roll ]

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:49.033
Tonight's stocking stuffer is...

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.667
-Ray-Ban Meta smart glasses!

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:53.567
-That's right, Jimmy.
Ray-Ban and Meta

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.901
blended their iconic style
and cutting-edge technology

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.767
in their brand-new
smart glasses.

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.534
Now you can capture your story

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.501
and share your unique POV
hands-free.

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:02.901
With a built-in
12-megapixel camera

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:04.667
and a five-mic system,

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:06.334
you can record
life's best moments,

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:08.267
make calls, listen to music,
live stream,

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.934
and ask Meta AI while staying
in the present moment.

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.267
Jimmy...

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:15.033
-That's right!

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.901
Thank you, Meta,
for providing these glasses.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:21.133
Stick around. We'll be right
back with more "Tonight Show"!

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:31.968
♪♪

